---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site-config";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="sr-only">
      Hi, I'm {SITE.author.firstName}, a Cyber Security student from {SITE.location.countryName} pursuing a BSc at De Montfort University.
      I am interested in Digital Forensics and Incident Response, Security Operations, Network Analysis, and Threat Intelligence.
    </p>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="text-sm font-light">
      <p class="text-sm font-light">
        Hi, I'm {SITE.author.firstName}, currently pursuing a BSc in Cyber Security at De Montfort University, {SITE.location.countryName}.
      </p>
      <br />
      Areas of interest:
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Digital Forensics &amp; Incident Response</li>
        <li>Security Operations (SOC)</li>
        <li>Network Analysis</li>
        <li>Threat Intelligence</li>
        <li>Malware Analysis</li>
        <li>Penetration Testing</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm font-light mt-2">
        Languages: English, Romanian.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      Passionate about understanding how systems are attacked and building the skills to defend them.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
